Teach the GYP build about the BSDs.

build_mozc.py knows Linux, Mac and Windows, so on a BSD AddTargetPlatformOption
leaves default_target unset and the script dies with "Unknown target_platform:
None" (run 35794480006).  Name the five BSDs, send them down the Linux path,
and put their output in out_bsd.

This follows what pkgsrc carries for mozc 2.26 (inputmethod/mozc-server226),
written against 3.33.6089.  CI only for now.

